4. Configure the agent to use your records

Once the Excel file is added, configure the agent to prioritise your supplied knowledge.

If your interface provides an option such as Only use specified sources, enable it if appropriate for your intended use. Microsoft notes that this setting prioritises designated sources, but in Agent Builder it does not completely prevent the model from using general knowledge. 

This helps ensure that questions about your actual production problems are grounded in the historical records rather than generic assumptions.

Next, save or create the agent using the controls available in your interface.

