One final recommendation

Build Version 1 around historical problem intelligence—not automatic production remediation.

Once the agent reliably retrieves records, identifies useful patterns, and produces evidence-backed recommendations, you can extend it to scheduled reporting, approved ServiceNow integrations, and tracking preventive actions.

